              "content": "{A思考}21，34，55，89……\n嗯，位置还更左边一点？\n所以在……诶！<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_825901_1408175521_content",
                "value": "{A思考}21，34，55，89……\n嗯，位置还更左边一点？\n所以在……诶！<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>！",
                "duration": null,
